NAME
    gcloud apihub api-hub-instances - manage Api Hub Instance resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub api-hub-instances COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Api Hub Instance resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create an Api Hub Instance.

     delete
        Delete an Api Hub Instance.

     describe
        Describe an Api Hub Instance.

     lookup
        lookup apiHubInstances.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub api-hub-instances

